		<content type="html" xml:base="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/viewtopic.php?p=41875#p41875"><![CDATA[
Thanks a lot it works !!! and with the complexity of O(n²)<br><br>Here the final code for peoples who want it<br><div class="codebox"><p>Code: </p><pre><code># pop =&gt; Array of multibody personal class where is stored the unique ID and number of links and all the links matricesdef removeAllColisions(pop):    for elem in pop:        # Get the numbre of sub-object/links in the multibody        for i in range(-1, elem.nbobj):            p.setCollisionFilterGroupMask(elem.getId(), i, 0, 0)            p.setCollisionFilterPair(0, elem.getId(), -1, i, 1)</code></pre></div><p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=13209">Lewho</a> — Tue Feb 19, 2019 11:34 am</p><hr />
]]></content>
